          "Lists balance checks for resistance, minimum damage, and stacking behavior."
        ]
      },
      {
        "input": "Refactor a skill that directly mutates combat state during damage calculation.",
        "output": [
          "Identifies which logic belongs in the calculation system and which logic belongs in the workflow system.",
