          "Notes edge cases for invulnerability, lethal damage, and combat logs."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "best_practices": [
      "Start by deciding whether each rule is calculation logic or workflow state logic.",
      "Return complete result objects so workflow handlers do not recalculate combat math.",
      "Check mitigation priority and turn phase order before adding new effects."
